  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin076-wangbin:origins" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin076-wangbin:origins:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDB">彬</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin076-wangbin:origins:m0002" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDB">世儒</persName>，琅邪人。祖<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin076-wangbin:origins:m0010" ref="7r6_k52_qji_AB">覽</persName>，父<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin076-wangbin:origins:m0013" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABD">正</persName>，並有名德。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin076-wangbin:affinity" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin076-wangbin:affinity:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABDB">彬</persName>爽氣出儕類，有雅正之韻。與<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-007-jin076-wangbin:affinity:m0014" ref="dkn_ge4_286_AAAAAAA">元帝</persName>姨兄弟，佐佑皇業，累遷侍中。</p>
